      "type": "SINGLE_CHOICE",
      "stem": "二进制数 10 对应的十进制数是多少？",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "content": "2"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "content": "1"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "content": "10"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "content": "0"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": "选 A。二进制 10₂ 的两位从左到右权值分别是 2 和 1，所以 1 × 2 + 0 × 1 = 2。",
